                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: People seem to be very interested in the robotics conference that we’re planning. Now that the date and venue have been announced, we’re getting a lot of registrations.\\nB: That’s great to hear. I think the next step will be to order name tags. They could include the company logos as well.\\nA: Well, unfortunately, we can’t get the name tags now. We don’t have the full list of attendees completed yet, as we should leave more time for registration. Could we do something else instead?\\nB: OK, let’s print the promotional posters today, as the design is ready to go.\"}]]}]]}"
